# -------------- link along current taped route, to close loop
# surveyed 21-12-96 by CJD (notes), JC (inst), Becka Lawson (tape)

survey lotdlink
# start N up LotD to tie-in
# ** Suggest 10 is near LOTD 1.0 original route by GL,CB.
# ** Jct noted going NW at 10 supports this. But E-W discrepancy = 5m,
# too big. Gross error somewhere?
centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  11	10	22.79	151	0
  12	11	8.42	208	+10
  # 12 is pss by JC/TCG/PAR, jct W heads to Dogleg Complex
  13	12	8.83	202	-11
  14	13	11.28	219	-25
  15	14	4.35	141	+43	# 15 = LotD 1.4 by GL,CB
endcentreline
endsurvey
# Present (taped) route tied in with original route by GL, CB.

