endcentreline
endsurvey

# --------------- The Glitz
# side passage West off LotD somewhere near LOTD sta K0 by GL,CB
# Explored & surveyed 21-12-96 by CJD (notes), JC (inst), Becka Lawson (tape)

survey glitz
# From	to	tape	comp	clino
centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  2	1	6.68	162	+15
  # 2 is pss on left wall. 1 is disappointing rift
  3	2	7.32	161.5	+17
  # betw 2 & 3 is pit in floor. Poss. source of draft, diggable, but lots of gypsum.
  3	4	10.0	345	0	# estimated
  3	5	10.25	025.5	+17
  5	6	7.38	023	-12
  # hole beneath 6 drops to low crawl, closes down.
  6	7	6.20	050	-44
  7	8	10.0	285	0	# estimated
  9	7	4.90	264	0
  # 9 is new pss, W side of LOTD
  # ** Suggest 9 is between LOTD 2.0 and 2.1 by GL,CB
  9	10	13.97	357	-2
  # station 10 is the same as Luck.K0, I think
endcentreline
endsurvey

